LeaseBreakRule.description:
What the statute lets a landlord keep for a tenancy ended early. ``actual_rent``: only
the rent actually lost (after mitigation), not a flat fee (Michigan, Indiana, North Carolina);
``cap_months_rent``: a fee up to ``months_rent`` x rent when the agreement provides it (Oregon
1.5, Florida 2 with a signed addendum); ``nonstandard_provision``: only under a signed
nonstandard provision (Wisconsin). Every case is 'depends' (facts the request cannot state);
the cap limits the amount.
